  "result": "Perfect! All 353 tests pass (added 16 new merge tests).\n\nThe customer merge feature is complete with:\n\n**`src/customers.js`:**\n- `mergeCustomers(customers, invoices, fromId, intoId)` function:\n  - Merges duplicate customers by moving invoices and deleting the duplicate\n  - Normalizes both customer IDs (trim whitespace, uppercase)\n  - Returns ok({ customers, invoices }) with:\n    - fromId customer removed from customers array\n    - All invoices with customerId = fromId reassigned to intoId\n  - Errors:\n    - CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND if either ID doesn't exist\n    - SAME_CUSTOMER if both IDs are the same customer\n  - Non-mutating: creates new arrays and objects\n\n**`src/errors.js`:**\n- Added SAME_CUSTOMER error code\n\n**Tests:**\n- 16 comprehensive tests covering:\n  - Basic merge functionality (customer removed, invoices reassigned)\n  - Error cases (missing customers, same customer)\n  - ID normalization (case insensitive, whitespace handling)\n  - Multiple invoices from duplicate customer\n  - No mutation of input arrays\n  - Null array handling\n  - Three+ customers in the system\n  - Field preservation through merge\n  - Mixed case and spacing in IDs",
